{"id":"630390","name":"烤黑芝麻馍片","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630390/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"360g"},{"name":"低筋面粉","amount":"650g"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"30g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"个大鸡蛋中放入花生油。","img":"images/630390/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅匀。","img":"images/630390/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入面粉和黑芝麻和酵母。","img":"images/630390/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"戴上一次性pvc手套，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/630390/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，发酵三个小时左右。","img":"images/630390/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发好的面团。","img":"images/630390/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"擀成面片。","img":"images/630390/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切成小块。再二次发酵二十分钟左右。","img":"images/630390/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烤箱180度预热八分钟，馍1片放入烤箱，上下管180度烤15分钟。","img":"images/630390/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅","img":"images/630390/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}